From: Cong Nguyen <cong.nguyen.zn@renesas.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Apr 2025 03:25:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/16] Add support for CRU driver

Currently this driver is disable in the dts file.
Set status to "okay" to enable CRU driver.

Upstream-Status: Pending
